3c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUPSSSC Official Website\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;UPSSSC Lekhpal Eligibility Answer Key 2026 : Important Question\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"205f0b61-ec09-49d8-8828-50da79d98abd\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Who releases the \u003cstrong\u003eUPSSSC Lekhpal Answer Key 2026?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The Answer Key is released by the \u003cstrong\u003eUttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC) on its official website.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e In what format is the \u003cstrong\u003eAnswer Key released?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The answer key is generally published in \u003cstrong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"405\"\u003ePDF format\u003c/strong\u003e containing the roll numbers of qualified candidates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Where can candidates check the \u003cstrong\u003eAnswer Key?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Candidates can check in the \u003cstrong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"586\"\u003eAnswer Key / Notifications\u003c/strong\u003e section of the official UPSSSC website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What details are required to\u003cstrong\u003e check the answer key?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: Usually, candidates only need their Roll Number or Registration Number to search in the PDF file.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;What is the official website for\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eUPSSSC\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;The official website for\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eUPSSSC \u003c/strong\u003eis \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://upsssc.gov.in/\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-35399 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-22T174851.468-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"UPSSSC Lekhpal Answer Key 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-